chor="/document/118/200147/bssPhr14/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/200147/dfas2746z8/" data-dfa="dfas2746z8"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/200147/dfasvhsk3u/" data-dfa="dfasvhsk3u"></a>Регистрационный номерНДС: <span class="fill">1111111111<span id="sfwc_8" class="sfwc"></span><span class="tooltip__wrapper"><span class="tooltip__point no-print"></span><span class="tooltip_text no-print"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200147/dfasfzddor/" data-dfa="dfasfzddor"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/200147/bssPhr15/"></a>данные подтянутся автоматически</span></span></span></p><p><a data-anchor="/document/118/200147/bssPhr16/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/200147/dfas1np5gy/" data-dfa="dfas1np5gy"></a>Банковский счет: <span class="fill">1111 1111 1111 1111 1111</span><span id="sfwc_9" class="sfwc"></span><span class="tooltip__wrapper"><span class="tooltip__point no-print"></span><span class="tooltip_text no-print"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200147/dfasrernh3/" data-dfa="dfasrernh3"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/200147/bssPhr17/"></a>данные подтянутся автоматически</span></span></p><p><a data-anchor="/document/118/200147/bssPhr18/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/200147/dfas3a5o5d/" data-dfa="dfas3a5o5d"></a>МФО банка: 11 111</p></td><td style="vertical-align: top;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/118/200147/bssPhr19/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/200147/dfastnpikm/" data-dfa="dfastnpikm"></a>Покупатель</p><p><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200147/dfasw0zswf/" data-dfa="dfasw0zswf"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/200147/bssPhr20/"></a>ООО «Альфа»<span id="sfwc_10" class="sfwc"></span><span class="tooltip__wrapper"><span class="tooltip__point no-print"></span><span class="tooltip_text no-print"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200147/dfas8whobb/" data-dfa="dfas8whobb"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/200147/bssPhr21/"></a>укажите покупателя</span></span></span></p><p><a data-anchor="/document/118/200147/bssPhr22/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/200147/dfasxikllu/" data-dfa="dfasxikllu"></a>Адрес: <span class="fill">г. Ташкент, ул. Бочка, 18<span id="sfwc_11" class="sfwc"></span><span class="tooltip__wrapper"><span class="tooltip__point no-print"></span><span class="tooltip_text no-print"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200147/dfas1xng9q/" data-dfa="dfas1xng9q"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/200147/bssPhr23/"></a>укажите юридический адрес покупателя</span></span></span></p><p><a data-anchor="/document/118/200147/bssPhr24/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/200147/dfaszcgadq/" data-dfa="dfaszcgadq"></a>Идентификационный номер</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/118/200147/bssPhr25/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/200147/dfas9l50q7/" data-dfa="dfas9l50q7"></a>покупателя (ИНН):&nbsp;<span class="fill">3333333333<span id="sfwc_12" class="sfwc"></span><span class="tooltip__wrapper"><span class="tooltip__point no-print"></span><span class="tooltip_text no-print"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200147/dfas4p83r8/" data-dfa="dfas4p83r8"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/200147/bssPhr26/"></a>укажите стоимость поставки</span></span></span></p><p><a data-anchor="/document/118/200147/bssPhr27/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/200147/dfas62yu6e/" data-dfa="dfas62yu6e"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/200147/dfastgxm9r/" data-dfa="dfastgxm9r"></a>Регистрационный номерНДС: <span class="fill">3333333333</span></p><p><a data-anchor="/document/118/200147/bssPhr28/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/200147/dfas28cb5p/" data-dfa="dfas28cb5p"></a>Банковский счет: <span class="fill">1111 1111 1111 1111 1111</span><span id="sfwc_13" class="sfwc"></span><span class="tooltip__wrapper"><span class="tooltip__point no-print"></span><span class="tooltip_text no-print"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200147/dfasvs2i7b/" data-dfa="dfasvs2i7b"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/200147/bssPhr29/"></a>данные подтянутся автоматически</span></span></p><p><a data-anchor="/document/118/200147/bssPhr30/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/1